   "Source" form shall mean the preferred form for making modifications, 
   including but not limited to software source code, documentation source, 
   Hardware Design files, and configuration files.

   "Object" (or "Binary") form shall mean any form resulting from mechanical 
   transformation, translation, or physical realization of a Source form, 
   including but not limited to compiled object code, executable binaries, 
   bytecode, generated documentation, physical circuit boards, manufactured 
   enclosures, and conversions to other media types.

   "Derivative Works" shall mean any work, whether in Source or Object (or 
